title: Wilhelm Dittmann
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor, left
card-image: img/portraits/DittmannWilhelm.jpg
view-if: dittmann_advisor = 1
new-page: true

= Wilhelm Dittmann

Dittmann is [? if chancellor = "Dittmann": the current Chancellor and ?][? if president = "Dittmann": the current President and ?] an accomplished member of our party – a former vice-president of the Reichstag, one of the founding members of the defunct USPD, and former member of the Council of People’s Deputies.

- @pacifism
- @uspd_cooperation
- @chancellor
- @president
- @debug_never
- @root: Return to main

@pacifism
title: Rally against Militarism
choose-if: advisor_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_timer += 6; pacifism += 1; nationalism -= 2*(1 - dissent); workers_spd += 4*(1 - dissent) if pacifism >= 3; unemployed_spd += 3*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 3; nationalism -= 3*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 3; new_middle_spd += 4*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 3

@uspd_cooperation
title: Cooperation with the [+ uspd_name_colour +]
subtitle: Any cooperation between the parties requires compromise from the [+ uspd_name +] as well as the SPD.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_strength += 5; uspd_relation += 6*(1-dissent); reformist_dissent += 3; communist_coalition += 1 if uspd_cooperation_seen <= 1; uspd_cooperation_seen += 1

Levi attempts to reach out to his former colleagues to dissuade the [+ uspd_name +] from their current extreme path. Some concessions are extracted.

Our speakers denounce the military establishment and all the spending entering that black hole. Some adventurous speakers question the responsibility of the military elites in organizing the Great War.

[? if pacifism < 3 : Given the volume of nationalist indoctrination in our society, it is difficult to argue so vehemently against the military. ?]
[? if pacifism >= 3 : Since we have consistently made pacifism a theme of our campaign, the workers are enthusiastic about our message. ?]

@snap_election
title: Snap Election
subtitle: Call a snap election.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if chancellor != "Dittmann" : Dittmann must be Chancellor or President. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and (chancellor == "Dittmann")
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; time_to_election = 3
call: set_next_election_time

We have called for new elections, set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].

@debug_never
title: DEBUG: Never
subtitle: Never = 1
view-if: legislature_enabled
on-arrival: never = 1

Never enabled

@chancellor
title: Use the Chancellorship
subtitle: As the current Chancellor, Dittmann can make use of their position to further our goals.
view-if: chancellor == "Dittmann"
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
go-to: chancellor

@president
title: Use the Presidency
subtitle: As the current President, Dittmann can make use of their position to further our goals.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
view if: president == "Dittmann"

- @article_48: We can use Article 48!
- @military_relations: We can improve our relations with the Reichswehr.
- @on_the_world_stage: We can improve our relations on the world stage.
- @presidential_snap_election: We can call snap elections!
- @reichsexecution: We can order a Reichsexekution!

@article_48
choose-if: chancellor_party == "SPD" and not presidential_powers and article_48_timer <= 8 and judicial_reform >= 3 and ((neorevisionist_strength+left_strength+unemployed >= 50) or in_emergency_government)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if judicial_reform < 3 : The reactionary judiciary would strike them down as unconstitutional. ?][? if neorevisionist_strength+left_strength+unemployed < 50 : The party views these decrees as unecessary. ?][? if article_48_timer > 8 : [+ article_48_timer +] months before we can next take this action. ?]
go-to: article_48

@military_relations
view-if: not victory_republic
choose-if: military_relations_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ military_relations_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
go-to: military_relations

@on_the_world_stage
choose-if: on_the_world_stage_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ on_the_world_stage_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
go-to: on_the_world_stage

@presidential_snap_election
go-to: presidential_snap_election

@reichsexekution
choose-if: reichsexekution_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ reichsexekution_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
go-to: reichsexekution

